          "identity_status": "provisional",
          "language": "en",
          "notes": "Project Gutenberg identifies this English text with Helen Zimmern's translation. Its transcriber describes a Complete Works source from 1909-1913 and changes to typography, footnote placement and spelling. This provisional Expression names the reported electronic textual realization, not every Zimmern translation or an identified historical print edition. Only the catalog and opening attribution/transcriber note were inspected on 2026-09-09 UTC. Full-text fidelity, exact print ancestry and equivalence remain unassessed. The ebook release and update dates are not historical publication dates. No Edition, Item, responsibility admission, text payload, rights clearance or publication permission is created here.",
          "preferred_label": "По ту сторону добра и зла — английская текстовая реализация Project Gutenberg № 4363",
